1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,040
Tepat lu itu gak pas buat lo datungin.

2
00:00:09,679 --> 00:00:11,080
Tapi ini masalahnya rumah gue, Din.

3
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,339
Rumah gue jauh lebih penting.

4
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,900
Lo pikir selama ini gue bayar sekolah lu?

5
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,240
Lo terima?

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,359
Setiap hari, sen!

7
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:56,359
Bicik nih.

8
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:57,700
Kita cepet, kita cepet sekarang.

9
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,320
Gak bisa, ya.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,599
Kalian harus mati, anjing!

11
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:09,219
Kalo kita gak mati, mereka kita yang mati, Bang!

12
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Bang! Bang!

